{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of a doctor in the town of Stagmarch, where an otherworldly illness is mutating residents. Get to know your patients, diagnose their illnesses, and treat them. However, you have limited medicine, and every day your patients get worse. How far will you go to save others?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET THE PATIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/JermaineMTP.png?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/JoannaMTP.png?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/MorganMTP.png?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHO YOU SAVE MATTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/WHO_YOU_SAVE_MATTERS.gif?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your patients all hold important roles in Stagmarch, and the town will feel their absence. More than just their fates rest in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU CANNOT SAVE EVERYONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/YOU_CANNOT_SAVE_EVERYONE.gif?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's not enough medicine to go around, and as the only doctor you'll have to decide who gets treated and who gets left behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEARN ABOUT YOUR PATIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/GET_TO_KNOW_YOUR_PATIENTS.gif?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout 3 days of work at the town's clinic, get to know your patients. Find out who they really are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/CRAFTING.gif?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To treat the sick, harvest herbs from the clinic\u2019s garden and make your own medicines from them. Refer to the prior doctor\u2019s notes if you need to, because if you screw it up you could make things worse...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/IMMERSIVE_ATMOSPHERE.gif?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mansion turned clinic, discover what sort of secrets linger within these halls\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Triage features many endings, all different varieties of bad!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507500?t=1744858927","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/123a9f8e81fd597e75080137b9e6c155f9bce8ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744858927","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/838e4c819e646855ce18295c64a3d7d376382703/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744858927","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/838e4c819e646855ce18295c64a3d7d376382703/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744858927","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Triage will contain strong language, blood, and medical malpractice."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of a doctor in the town of Stagmarch, where an oth