atients. Find out who they really are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/CRAFTING.gif?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To treat the sick, harvest herbs from the clinic\u2019s garden and make your own medicines from them. Refer to the prior doctor\u2019s notes if you need to, because if you screw it up you could make things worse...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/extras/IMMERSIVE_ATMOSPHERE.gif?t=1744858927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mansion turned clinic, discover what sort of secrets linger within these halls\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Triage features many endings, all different varieties of bad!</p>","developers":["5'Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507500/6a74ae4883da8a0674538fd374034f41515de219/header.jpg?t=1744858927","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126523,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126523/movie480.mp4?t=1744858890","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126523/movie_max.mp4?t=1744858890"},"name":"Triage - Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126523/1b33c096baa47dfb07848c9afe8cad4598930f1a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744858890","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126523/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744858890","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126523/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744858890"}}],"name":"Triag